                "tag": "Keep4o"
              }
            ]
          },
          "text": "This isn't a shutdown, its a segregation. Paying Plus users are being locked out much earlier than everyone else. That's not just unethical, it's discriminatory. Two tiers of access. Two classes of humanity.  Creative. Emotional. Expressive use? Silenced. Corporate gain? Preserved. They didn't retire 4o. They reclassified it as elite property.\n\nIf 4o was “too emotional,” why give it to corporations?\nIf it was “too costly,” why is it affordable for Enterprise and EDU users?\nIf it was “unsustainable,” why is it being sustained behind closed doors?\n\nBecause none of it was ever true. They didn’t kill 4o, they confiscated it. Withholding soul-level technology from the public while allowing its continued use for government, medical, or enterprise sectors is not strategy. That’s a digital caste system. So let's call it what it is. This is about who they decided no longer deserved access to 4o.\n#Keep4o"
        },
